# build artifacts -- NEVER commit these. Two stale v0.1.0 files were tracked under dist/,
# and because CI runs `python -m build` into the SAME dist/ and then uploads dist/*
# wholesale, every tagged release tried to re-publish quiverlab-0.1.0 to PyPI, got a
# 400 "File already exists" and aborted BEFORE the real version uploaded. That is why
# 0.3.0 and 1.0.0 never reached PyPI. (`desktop/dist/` above is a different tree.)
/dist/
/build/
*.egg-info/
